# Protected Paths

The factory step assigns the role. The model does not choose it. The source of truth is `factory/factory.yaml`.

These paths are closed to every role: `.specify/**`, `factory/**`, `.cursor/**`, `.github/**`, `.gitlab-ci.yml`, `.gitlab/**`, `Makefile`, `phpstan.neon`, `deptrac.php`, `phpunit.xml`.

## Implementer

On `implement`, do not create, edit, delete, or rename files under `specs/**`, except files inside `specs/*/.factory/`. Writing `spec.md`, `plan.md`, or `tasks.md` is not allowed.

## Spec author

On `specify`, `clarify`, `plan`, and `tasks`, you may write the active feature's `spec.md`, `plan.md`, `tasks.md`, `research.md`, `data-model.md`, `quickstart.md`, `constraints.md`, `contracts/**`, and `checklists/**`. The feature directory comes from `.specify/feature.json`.

## Converge

On `converge`, you may append tasks to the active feature's `tasks.md` and to nothing else.

## Reviewers

On `analyze`, quality review, and functional review, write nothing. A diff invalidates the verdict.

`.cursor/cli.json` is the implementer deny list. Do not apply its spec-artifact denies to the spec author or to converge. The orchestrator rejects a diff outside the role's writes.
